.TH WAVE-MANUAL 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-manual \- Show the full manual — the same text that ships as man pages and info files — or just one command's section.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave manual [<command>] [\-\-zh] [\-\-color]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the full manual — the same text that ships as man pages and info
files — or just one command's section.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-zh
Print the Chinese edition
.TP
.B \-\-color
Colour headings and flags (plain text by default)

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave manual
wave manual install
wave manual --zh
wave manual install --color
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
